abstract: >-
  Code, pre-registrations with their logs, claim ledger and recorded runs of
  an out-of-time evaluation of TabPFN-3 and TabICLv2 beside a
  weight-of-evidence scorecard and a tuned gradient-boosting model, on the
  origination vintages of Lending Club and of Freddie Mac's Single-Family
  Loan-Level Dataset, reading discrimination as cohorts age, calibration and
  population stability against pre-registered kill criteria.
